   "source": [
    "# 训练（fine-tuning）与推理（Inference）\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. 微调流程\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. 安装依赖\n",
    "  ```shell\n",
    "  pip install transformers datasets accelerate peft bitsandbytes\n",
    "  ```\n",
    "- transformers: 模型与训练接口\n",
    "- datasets: 数据加载与预处理\n",
    "- accelerate: 高效分布式训练\n",
    "- peft: 参数高效微调（如 LoRA）\n",
    "- bitsandbytes: 支持低精度参数（如 8-bit/4-bit 量化）\n",
    "\n",
    "\n"
   ]
